d-managed horizon bearing. (\u001b[2mrun `just keel bearing show VDcStPNlr` and confirm status `parked` with recommendation `Park \u2192 revisit later`\u001b[0m)\r\n  \u001b[38;2;255;244;214;48;2;112;80;0;1mMG-06\u001b[0m - Leave the board doctor-clean with the new horizon visible through mission, bearing-list, and flow surfaces. (\u001b[2mrun `just keel doctor`, `just keel bearing list`, and `just flow`\u001b[0m)\r\n\r\n\u001b[1mChildren\u001b[0m\r\n  Bearings (1):\r\n    \u001b[1m\u001b[94mVDcStPNlr\u001b[39m\u001b[0m - GPU Execution Support (\u001b[2mparked\u001b[0m)\r\n\r\n\u001b[1mStructural Drift\u001b[0m\r\n  Coefficient: 0.63 (severe)\r\n  Coverage:    entities 302/302 | knowledge 5/43 | source 0/0 | docs 0/17\r\n  Context:     38 knowledge units lack source provenance; 17 project docs are unlinked\r\n\r\n\u001b[1mLatest Log Entry\u001b[0m\r\n    2026-03-11T20:25:00\r\n"]
